[23.062274,"o","thesada-fw shell - commands grouped by category\r\r\ntype `help <category>` to expand (e.g. `help cell`)\r\r\n\r\r\nCategories:\r\r\n  console      (1 cmd)\r\r\n  fs           (8 cmds)\r\r\n  config       (6 cmds)\r\r\n  net          (6 cmds)\r\r\n  ota          (2 cmds)\r\r\n  cert         (3 cmds)\r\r\n  secret       (3 cmds)\r\r\n  boot         (1 cmd)\r\r\n  chip         (1 cmd)\r\r\n  identity     (2 cmds)\r\r\n  module       (2 cmds)\r\r\n  cell         (5 cmds)\r\r\n  lua          (3 cmds)\r\r\n  temp         (1 cmd)\r\r\n  lora         (4 cmds)\r\r\n\r\r\nTop-level:\r\r\n  help                 Show categories or expand one (help <cat>)\r\r\n  version              Firmware version and build\r\r\n  restart              Reboot device\r\r\n  heap                 Free heap memory\r\r\n  uptime               Device uptime\r\r\n  sensors              Sensor readings info\r\r\n  selftest             Run self-test checks\r\r\n  partitions           Full partition table dump\r\r\n  sdkconfig            Selected CONFIG_* relevant to OTA/boot\r\r\n  sleep                Sleep config, boot count\r\r\n"]
